  "text": "### Immediate Actions  \n1. **Record Complaint**\n- Date and time received\n- Customer name and account number\n- Complaint details (verbatim if verbal)\n- Channel received through\n- Staff member receiving  \n2. **Acknowledge to Customer**\n- Branch: Immediate verbal acknowledgment + written confirmation\n- Phone: Verbal acknowledgment + written confirmation within 24 hours\n- Email: Automated receipt confirmation\n- Letter: Written acknowledgment within 2 business days  \n3. **Log in System**\n- Create complaint record in CRM\n- Assign complaint ID\n- Tag by category\n- Assign to appropriate handler  \n---",
